<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><%- include('partials/head') %></head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/nav', { user, activePage: 'best-practices' }) %>

  <main class="simple-page legal-page">
    <a href="javascript:history.back()" class="breadcrumb-back">&larr; Back</a>

    <h2>💡 Best Way to Use doneche</h2>
    <p>Get the most out of doneche with these tips from real users:</p>

    <h3>1. Log applications the same day you apply</h3>
    <p>Use Magic Upload right after you submit — screenshot the confirmation page or forward the confirmation email so the 7-day ghost clock starts accurately.</p>

    <h3>2. Fill in HR contact details when you have them</h3>
    <p>Adding an HR contact name/email up front means your follow-up email is ready to send the instant a card gets flagged as Ghosted — no digging through old emails.</p>

    <h3>3. Check your board weekly</h3>
    <p>Set a recurring reminder to review your Kanban board once a week. Move cards, send follow-ups on anything Ghosted, and keep momentum going.</p>

    <h3>4. Send the follow-up — don't just read it</h3>
    <p>Editing and sending the ready-made follow-up template is proven to re-open conversations. Personalize the first line, then send.</p>

    <h3>5. Keep your profile and resume up to date</h3>
    <p>Upload your latest resume in Profile to get better matches on the Jobs page and more accurate AI-assisted extraction.</p>

    <h3>6. Refer friends to unlock more</h3>
    <p>Referrals unlock the AI Interview Simulator, AI Resume/ATS Matcher, and extra tracking capacity — share your referral link from the dashboard.</p>

    <p>Ready to put these into practice? <a href="/register">Get started free</a>.</p>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>


